# C8 item 1, ANION model: OptTS at the relaxed-scan maximum.
#
# Seed: ts_anion/job.xyz = scan_anion/job.005.xyz, the 1.80 A point -- the
# maximum of the relaxed scan of C128...O133 (ketone carbon to the HOO- oxygen),
# which rises ~17 kJ/mol off the bonded 1.40 end. That scan is the whole point:
# it located the barrier on the anion surface, which the relay model never gave.
#
# System: HOO- + ketone, no water (the water and the relay proton were removed
# from the relay TS; 133 atoms). QM1 = 17 atoms, charge -1.
#
# Charge convention (settled 2026-09-25): the QM region's charge is on the
#   * xyzfile line; %QMMM Charge_total is the whole system. Here QM -1, host 0,
#   total -1; * xyzfile -1 1 gives 94 electrons (even), singlet valid.
! QM/XTB B97-3c ddCOSMO(Water) OptTS Freq TightOpt TightSCF

%QMMM
QMATOMS
	{55 58 61 64 120 121 122 123 124 125 126 127 128 129 130 131 132}
END
Charge_total -1
Mult_total 1
AutoFF_QM2_Method GFNFF
END

%geom
  MaxIter 400
  Calc_Hess true
end

%output jsonpropfile true end

%maxcore 4000

%pal
   nprocs 8
end

* xyzfile -1 1 job.xyz
